{"errors":[{"field":"shortDescription","location":"body","message":"Short description must not exceed 500 characters","value":"ection 11 outlines permitted increases, which are limited to:\r\n\r\nIncreases in the landlord’s local rates since the “prescribed date”. \r\nParliament Zambia\r\n+1\r\n\r\nIn cases of structural improvements to the premises (excluding mere repairs or redecoration), the rent may be increased by an amount calculated at a rate not exceeding 15% per annum of the expenditure so incurred. \r\nZambialii\r\n+1\r\n\r\n✅ So, in short:\r\n\r\nThere is no blanket allowance for an increase of “more than 5%” per year (or any fixed flat percentage) for all cases.\r\n\r\nThe law allows increases only under very specific conditions (increase in rates or structural improvements) and with limits (e.g., up to 15% per annum of improvement cost in one case).\r\n\r\nOutside those circumstances, raising rent arbitrarily beyond the standard rent is not permissible under the Act.\r\n\r\n⚠️ Practical implications:\r\n\r\nIf a landlord increases rent due to normal market conditions (not due to higher rates or structural improvements), that increase may not be legally valid under the Rent Act.\r\n\r\nIf a tenant is asked to pay an increased rent that appears to exceed what is permitted, they may have grounds to challenge it in court under the Act.\r\n\r\nThe term “standard rent” (defined in the Act) play"},{"field":"lowStockThreshold","location":"body","message":"Low stock threshold must be a non-negative integer","value":"NaN"},{"field":"weight","location":"body","message":"Weight must be a positive number","value":"{\"value\":\"1\",\"unit\":\"kg\"}"},{"field":"tags","location":"body","message":"Tags must be an array","value":"[]"},{"field":"variants","location":"body","message":"Variants must be an array","value":"[]"},{"field":"attributes","location":"body","message":"Attributes must be an array","value":"[]"},{"field":"specifications","location":"body","message":"Specifications must be an array","value":"[]"}],"ip":"::1","level":"warn","message":"Validation failed","method":"POST","path":"/","service":"gule-marketplace","timestamp":"2025-10-22 11:21:36"}
